# The demo assets under frontend/public/demo-media are deliberately tracked: Vercel serves
# them so the hosted dashboard and the players have media without object-storage
# credentials. The *.mp4 rule above had silently dropped the video from that folder,
# leaving the content library listing an asset that 404'd everywhere.
!frontend/public/demo-media/*.mp4
